  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116454",
      "title": "Extracting Query Parameters via Observables",
      "lectureOrder": 288,
      "videoOrder": 275,
      "sourceHash": "f99cd930b18a503e7cee79424cd15d51e7c852cc20c87cce0d17ed609cb0dc2b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "So how else can you get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 6.063,
          "en": "to that query parameter value that might be set?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.2,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "Well, essentially by using the same approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 12.09,
          "en": "we used before as an alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.09,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "to getting the route parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 16.98,
          "en": "If you're not relying on input binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.98,
          "end": 20.37,
          "en": "you can use this activated route object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.37,
          "end": 23.613,
          "en": "and set up a subscription to be notified about changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "So here we can add a new private property for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 29.98,
          "en": "called activatedRoute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.96,
          "end": 35.343,
          "en": "and we inject the activatedRoute object for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 40.59,
          "en": "And then for example, an ngOnInit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.59,
          "end": 44.07,
          "en": "and hence I'll implement the OnInit interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 47.28,
          "en": "so that I'm forced to add ngOnInit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.28,
          "end": 49.69,
          "en": "In there, we can use this activatedRoute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.64,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "and then there not use the paramMap,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.81,
          "end": 59.673,
          "en": "but instead the queryParams observable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 63.12,
          "en": "And then we can subscribe here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.12,
          "end": 67.11,
          "en": "to be notified about changes to these params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "So we can use that observer object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.53,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "and we'll get this params information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 75.81,
          "en": "so this params object automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.81,
          "end": 78.15299999999999,
          "en": "as an input to this next function then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "And in there, we can then use this information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "So instead of using this order input binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 87.003,
          "en": "we could then add a order property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 90.39,
          "en": "which initially might be undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.39,
          "end": 92.37,
          "en": "but which eventually should be a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.37,
          "end": 95.82300000000001,
          "en": "that's either asc or desc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "And here in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 104.13,
          "en": "we can set this order equal to params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.13,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "and then access this order key in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "So this item with a name of order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 111.42,
          "en": "and that name here is of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.42,
          "end": 115.05,
          "en": "the name of the query parameter you wanna extract.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.05,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "And since we have a subscription,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 120.273,
          "en": "this will be updated whenever the query parameters change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.83,
          "end": 123.45,
          "en": "Now, since we have a subscription,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.45,
          "end": 127.02,
          "en": "we should also clean it up as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 129.57,
          "en": "That is always a good idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.57,
          "end": 131.97,
          "en": "So I'll inject destroyRef",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.97,
          "end": 135.28,
          "en": "and then use to register this cleanup hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.13,
          "end": 142.13,
          "en": "and then we can simply store this subscription here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.44,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "in a constant or a variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 147.903,
          "en": "and unsubscribe here in this cleanup hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.49,
          "end": 151.653,
          "en": "But this here is the important part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.94,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "With that, this order property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 158.2,
          "en": "is set automatically and reactively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "and now we just need to change it here in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 164.613,
          "en": "since it's no longer a signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.31,
          "end": 170.64,
          "en": "but with those changes made, if you save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.64,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "you should have the same behavior as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "If you go a user, there is no query parameter information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 178.68,
          "en": "in the URL initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.68,
          "end": 180.93,
          "en": "So it says sort ascending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.93,
          "end": 183.81,
          "en": "If you click it, that's added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.81,
          "end": 186.69,
          "en": "and you can see that the text changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.69,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "and if you click it again, the query parameter changed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 193.08,
          "en": "So that's now also working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 196.2,
          "en": "but now without using this input binding feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 198.78,
          "en": "instead by using the queryParams observable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 200.043,
          "en": "on this activatedRoute.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
